></fn><fn id="TFN3"><label>c</label><p>Binding enthalpy in kcal/mol, which is indicative of productive, favorable binding contacts.</p></fn><fn id="TFN4"><label>d</label><p>Calorimetric initial heats of interaction in kcal/mol.</p></fn><fn id="TFN5"><label>e</label><p>Crystal structure (XTAL) of the Plk1 PBD-MQSpTPL complex has been described previously<xref rid="R12" ref-type="bibr">12</xref>. The other three structures have been determined in this study.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Data collection and refinement statistics (molecular replacement)</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PBD<sup>PL</sup></th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PBD<sup>S</sup> and PBD<sup>S+G</sup></th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PBD<sup>PP</sup></th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PBD<sup>LH</sup></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Data collection</bold></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Space group</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">P2<sub>1</sub>2<sub>1</sub>2<sub>1</sub></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">P2<sub>1</sub></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">P2<sub>1</sub>2<sub>1</sub>2<sub>1</sub></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">P2<sub>1</sub></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cell dimensions</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" va